    "detail": {
      "id": 1342511,
      "name": "\"Dreamland Equipment\" Meteor Blazing Gun",
      "desc": "A machine gun can be implanted on Tully's chest, firing out <color=#E48600>powerful projectiles</color>, but with a <color=#E48600>limited magazine capacity</color>. After firing all bullets in the magazine, it will <color=#E48600>reload</color>, and once reloaded can <color=#E48600>continue attacking</color>.\n\nWith each <color=#E48600>reload</color>, Tully will load projectiles corresponding to an attribute type of a randomly selected Agent in the squad.\n\nCan be upgraded using <color=#E48600>Projectile Dreamland Resonium</color> obtained from the <color=#E48600>modification workshop</color>.",
